  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --shadow: #0f0f1a;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin: 24px 0;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 80px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\nbutton:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    min-width: 60px;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = String(count);\n}\n\nif (countEl && increaseBtn && decreaseBtn && resetBtn) {\n  increaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    count += 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  decreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    count -= 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    count = 0;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Offline Pixel Counter\n\nA self-contained, offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `style.css` — pixel-themed styling\n- `app.js` — counter logic\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser. No server required.\n2. Click **+1** to increase the count, **−1** to decrease, and **Reset** to return to zero.\n3. The count supports negative numbers.\n\n## Keyboard Access\n\n- Press **Tab** to move focus between buttons.\n- Press **Enter** or **Space** to activate the focused button.\n- A visible focus ring indicates the active control.\n\n## Palette\n\n- Background: `#1a1a2e`\n- Card: `#16213e`\n- Accent: `#e94560`\n- Text: `#f0f0f0`\n- Shadow: `#0f0f1a`\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
